This product loads prebuilt tree-sitter grammar binaries that npm installs at install time
from the tree-sitter-wasms package (https://github.com/Gregoor/tree-sitter-wasms). Those
binaries are compiled from the individual tree-sitter grammar projects, which are MIT licensed
by their respective authors; the tree-sitter-wasms package itself declares Unlicense, which does
not restate the terms of the grammars it compiles. osnova does not redistribute these binaries:
they arrive on the user's machine as a declared npm dependency, and the terms of each grammar
project travel with that project's own repository.

The web-tree-sitter runtime (https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter) is MIT licensed.
